         "type": "text",
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "heading",
           "level": 3,
           "html": "Little Martians and the Human Memorial Monument",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "Published by <a href=\"https://www.untitledfrontier.studio/blog/logged-universe-3-little-martians-amp-the-human-memorial-monument\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Untitled Frontier</a>",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "\"Dear Diana,",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "Please don’t be scared. The world and life you once knew is millions of your years and kilometres away. You are safe and a part of my collection. Humanity will continue to thrive thanks to you. I’ve made sure of it and I hope you will understand. Let me explain.",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "I know that as a human, you have limitations in understanding my perception of reality, but I've put quite some effort into translating my experience. Even expressing myself as an “I” is a stretch for “me”. You see, humans are our ancestors… One of many.\"",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "button",
         "text": "Read it here!",
         "href": "https://untitledfrontier.mirror.xyz/GlHHR5rlsUnFvDFNm3AfQ7v1p_XkCBZN9d5tDKEcrYA",
         "size": "medium",
         "align": "center",
         "external": true
        }
       ]
      }
